1
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,340
Kill

2
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:36,300
Kill! Kill! Kill!

3
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:44,780
Li Family Army, hear my command!

4
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,340
All units retreat to defensive positions!

5
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,340
No offensive actions!

6
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,580
Isn't that the young mistress?

7
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,940
Indeed. Why is she standing before the gates of Nanliang's imperial palace?

8
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,140
What's going on here?

9
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,580
Don't be deceived by this woman!

10
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,660
She's been recruited by Nanliang's emperor!

11
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:59,740
Abandoning the massacre of our entire Li family!

12
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,900
Now she wants to capture and imprison us all!

13
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:04,980
Our only hope is to follow Zhu Huaichen into Nanliang's palace!

14
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,260
Make him emperor!

15
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:09,100
Then we can march against the Northern Jin imperial family for revenge!

16
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:10,260
You're lying!

17
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:11,900
Zhu Huaichen!

18
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:15,500
Now I understand how you managed to slaughter my entire Li family!

19
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:17,300
There was a traitor among us!

20
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:18,620
How dare you make such accusations!

21
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,580
Do you recognize the Li family's tiger tally?

22
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:23,980
This tiger tally

23
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:25,500
This

24
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:27,540
No good

25
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:29,100
Impossible

26
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:30,660
This can't be

27
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:34,420
My father isn't dead yet

28
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,100
You miscalculated

29
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:39,580
Zhu Huaijin, this was your doing

30
00:01:40,220 --> 00:01:42,820
Brothers, draw your swords

31
00:01:42,820 --> 00:01:43,860
Kill this woman

32
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:54,660
Li family army, hear my command

33
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:57,140
Zhu Huaichen slaughtered my entire Li family

34
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,820
Show no mercy

35
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:01,860
Kill! Kill! Kill!

36
00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:05,340
Zhu Huaichen, you have nowhere to run now

37
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:08,060
Today will be your last day

38
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:12,420
My greatest virtue is that I don't believe in fate

39
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:54,220
Even you betrayed me

40
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:58,100
Between you and me

41
00:02:59,460 --> 00:03:02,100
We're even now

42
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:20,740
Zhu Huaichen

43
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:23,020
Watching everything you desired

44
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:24,700
crumble before your very eyes

45
00:03:25,060 --> 00:03:27,500
How does it feel to be abandoned by all?

46
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:29,340
Li Zhi'an

47
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:36,060
As husband and wife, let us descend to hell together today

48
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:51,940
Seeing your emperor

49
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:53,340
Why don't you kneel?

50
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:54,980
I only kneel to heaven, earth, and my parents

51
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:57,540
Moreover, I'm not a subject of Nanliang

52
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:58,620
Why should I kneel?

53
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:00,300
Good

54
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:02,220
Extraordinary indeed

55
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:05,860
No wonder the Crown Prince is so fond of you

56
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:12,740
I'm drafting an imperial decree

57
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:15,540
to appoint Huaijin as Crown Prince

58
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:19,660
Huaijin will become Nanliang's future emperor

59
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:22,900
Destined to unify all under heaven

60
00:05:22,900 --> 00:05:24,100
and conquer Beijin

61
00:05:24,980 --> 00:05:27,900
But you must die

62
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:30,820
Your parents hiding in that peasant's cottage

63
00:05:31,300 --> 00:05:33,300
I've already sent men to bring them to the palace

64
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:36,020
You have rendered meritorious service in rehabilitating my reputation

65
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,140
I shall personally pour you this wine

66
00:05:43,780 --> 00:05:45,140
Drink this cup of wine

67
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:48,460
And Huaijin shall become Crown Prince

68
00:05:50,180 --> 00:05:51,180
While your parents

69
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:55,540
Shall be spared their lives

70
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:07,940
You may depart in peace

71
00:06:08,900 --> 00:06:13,300
I shall bury you in the imperial mausoleum with full concubine rites

72
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:16,580
You would never truly do this

73
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:19,940
Why deceive a dying woman with empty promises?

74
00:06:20,820 --> 00:06:22,580
Are you afraid my unfulfilled vengeance

75
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:24,900
Would haunt Huaijin as a restless spirit?

76
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:26,620
If that's your concern

77
00:06:26,980 --> 00:06:30,220
Then shouldn't you fear the ghost of Zhu Huaichen's birth mother more?

78
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:33,980
You... how did you know?

79
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:39,340
For your imperial power and insatiable ambition

80
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:40,980
You conspired against your own bedmate

81
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,420
Forced your son to matricide

82
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:45,340
Poisoned the sister who helped you ascend the throne

83
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:48,380
You disregard human life and trample upon morality

84
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:52,420
Yet expect such ill-gotten sovereignty to endure?

85
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:54,460
What a pipe dream

86
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:57,140
You're a dead man walking

87
00:06:57,260 --> 00:06:58,740
I'll humor your insolence for now

88
00:06:59,020 --> 00:07:02,060
I never expected you to be this brazen

89
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:03,420
Guards! Guards!

90
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:09,580
Somebody! Anyone!

91
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:11,740
Does it feel unbearable?

92
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:15,500
Surprised why the poison didn't affect me?

93
00:07:17,380 --> 00:07:19,620
You're the mastermind behind all these tragedies

94
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:21,260
Did you really think you'd get away with it?

95
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,380
Haven't you noticed

96
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:27,220
the incense in the burner smells peculiar today?

97
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:35,660
You actually poisoned me!

98
00:07:36,260 --> 00:07:40,100
Just returning the favor in kind

99
00:07:56,140 --> 00:07:57,380
Your son Zhu Huaiyu

100
00:07:57,740 --> 00:07:58,740
pays respects to the Emperor

101
00:08:01,100 --> 00:08:02,380
Father probably doesn't remember

102
00:08:02,900 --> 00:08:04,860
the palace maid who gave birth to me

103
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:06,740
Her name was Yinggu

104
00:08:07,820 --> 00:08:10,460
She only wanted to care for her sister's child in the palace

105
00:08:11,220 --> 00:08:14,140
Never expecting to bear your imperial seed

106
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:16,620
After mother gave birth to me

107
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:18,660
she suffered endless slander

108
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:20,780
struggling to raise me alone

109
00:08:22,580 --> 00:08:24,700
Fortunately the Seventh Prince found and supported us

110
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:26,300
teaching me both literature and martial arts

111
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:30,940
Today you name me Crown Prince

112
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:34,620
When I ascend the throne, I'll bring mother to the palace

113
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:36,380
and honor her as Empress Dowager

114
00:08:36,780 --> 00:08:41,500
You can peacefully retire as Emperor Emeritus

115
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:43,980
You...

116
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,300
After a lifetime of schemes

117
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:48,380
it's time to rest

118
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:09,540
I leave this to you
